  "grammarTitle": "Verbs Followed by -ing",
  "grammarNote": "Герундий (gerund) — глагол с окончанием -ing, работающий как существительное. Некоторые глаголы требуют ТОЛЬКО герундий.\n\n📌 Глаголы + gerund (-ing):\nenjoy → \"I enjoy reading.\" · love → \"She loves cooking.\"\navoid → \"She avoids eating sugar.\" · keep → \"He keeps forgetting.\"\nfinish → \"I finished writing.\" · miss → \"She misses living in Almaty.\"\nconsider → \"I'm considering studying abroad.\"\nstop → \"She stopped smoking.\" · start → \"He started exercising.\"\n\n📍 Предлоги тоже требуют gerund:\n\"good at swimming\" · \"interested in learning\" · \"instead of working\"\n\"before leaving\" · \"after finishing\" · \"without thinking\"\n\n⚠️ Типичные ошибки:\n❌ \"I enjoy to read.\" → ✅ \"I enjoy reading.\"\n❌ \"She finished to write.\" → ✅ \"She finished writing.\"\n❌ \"He avoids to eat sugar.\" → ✅ \"He avoids eating sugar.\"",
  "grammarTable": [
